# Figma ↔ shop-ui design system

Headless **Sable Muse** storefront. When translating Figma via MCP (`get_design_context`, Code Connect, `generate_figma_design`, `use_figma`), map to the tokens and components below. Do not invent a parallel design system. Prefer adapting Figma output to existing primitives and brand tokens.

Customer-facing brand is **Sable Muse** (US, USD). Do not reintroduce Modimal / ModiWeek copy. Internal cookie names may still say `modimal_`.

---

## 1. Token definitions

**Source of truth:** `src/app/globals.css`

No Style Dictionary, Tokens Studio export, or separate JSON/YAML token pipeline. Tokens are CSS custom properties on `:root`, wired into Tailwind v4 via `@theme inline`.

### Format

```css
/* Semantic values */
:root {
  --background: #fdfbf7;
  --brand: #8f6565;
  /* ... */
}

/* Tailwind color/font/radius bridges */
@theme inline {
  --color-brand: var(--brand);
  --font-sans: var(--font-sans-var);
  --radius-sm: 0px;
  --container-modimal: 1240px;
}
```

Use Tailwind utilities (`bg-brand`, `text-ink`, `max-w-modimal`), not raw hex in new UI, unless matching an existing one-off (e.g. hero backdrop `bg-[#c9b59c]`).

### Color map (Figma → code)

| Role | Hex | CSS / Tailwind |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Paper / page bg | `#FDFBF7` | `--background` → `bg-background` |
| Sable ink | `#1C1A17` | `--ink`, `--brand-navy` → `text-ink`, `text-brand-navy` |
| Muted ink | `#6B635B` | `--ink-muted`, `--muted-foreground`, `--brand-slate` |
| Rosewood CTA | `#8F6565` | `--brand`, `--primary` → `bg-brand`, `text-brand` |
| Brand hover | `#7A5454` | `--brand-hover` → `bg-brand-hover` |
| Soft rose (decorative) | `#C4A8A8` | `--brand-light` |
| Focus ring | `#A87C7C` | `--ring` → `ring-ring` |
| Taupe border | `#E1DCD6` | `--border`, `--brand-border` |
| Sand / muted surface | `#F5F0EA` | `--muted`, `--secondary`, `--surface-soft` |
| Olive (sustainability chips only) | `#5F6E50` | `--olive` → `text-olive` / `bg-olive` |
| Destructive | `#B3412F` | `--destructive` |
| Success | `#3D6B45` | `--success` |
| Warning | `#8A5A0C` | `--warning` |
| Sale / urgency | `#8C2F4A` | `--sale` |

**Rules:** Rosewood is for **fills** (buttons, accents), not body links. Links stay sable (`text-brand-navy`, `hover:text-brand-navy`). Radius tokens are **0** everywhere except color swatches and carousel dots (`rounded-full`).

### Typography

Loaded in `src/app/layout.tsx` via `next/font/google`:

| Role | Family | CSS var | Tailwind |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| UI / body | Source Sans 3 (400/500/600) | `--font-sans-var` | `font-sans` |
| Display / headings / wordmark | Cormorant Garamond (500/600, italic) | `--font-serif-var` | `font-serif`, `font-heading`, `font-display` |

Utility classes in `globals.css`:

- `.heading-page` — page titles (serif, responsive 2rem → 3rem)
- `.heading-section` — section titles (serif, responsive)
- `tracking-eyebrow` — `0.08em` (buttons, labels)
- `tracking-wordmark` — `0.14em` (logo lockup)
- `leading-copy` — `1.8` body leading

### Spacing / layout tokens

- Content width: `--container-modimal: 1240px` → `max-w-modimal` via `Container`
- Horizontal padding: `px-4 sm:px-5 md:px-8 lg:px-10` (inside `Container`)
- No separate spacing scale file; use Tailwind spacing scale

### Transformation

None. shadcn CSS variables + Tailwind v4 `@theme inline` only. `components.json` points `tailwind.css` at `src/app/globals.css`.

