## 2. Component library

### Primitives (shadcn `base-nova` on Base UI)

**Path:** `src/components/ui/`

| File | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `button.tsx` | CVA variants + `@base-ui/react/button` |
| `input.tsx` | Text inputs (`default` / `xl` sizes) |
| `label.tsx` | Form labels |
| `checkbox.tsx` | Checkbox |
| `badge.tsx` | `neutral` / `inverse` / `outline` |
| `accordion.tsx` | FAQ / PDP / mission |
| `dialog.tsx` | Modals |
| `sheet.tsx` | Drawers (bag, mobile nav patterns) |
| `aspect-ratio.tsx` | Media framing |
| `overlay-scrim.ts` | Shared backdrop class |

Config: `components.json` — style `base-nova`, `rsc: true`, `iconLibrary: lucide`, aliases `@/components`, `@/components/ui`.

**No Storybook.** No Code Connect files (`.figma.ts`) yet. Document behavior in `docs/pages.md` / this rule.

### Feature components (by domain)

```
src/components/
  ui/           primitives
  layout/       SiteHeader, SiteFooter, AnnouncementBar, DesktopNav
  navigation/   mobile nav, search overlay, mega-menu (collection page)
  home/         hero, collections, best sellers, follow-us, etc.
  product/      ProductCard, ProductExperience, gallery, purchase panel
  catalog/      CatalogBrowser, CatalogFilters
  cart/         bag sheet, cart page, quantity stepper, providers
  checkout/     stepper, forms, order summary
  search/       filters, chips, results bar
  content/      PolicyPage
  shared/       Container, SectionHeader, carousels, breadcrumbs
  icons/        custom social SVGs
  ...
```

### Architecture patterns

- **Server Components by default.** `"use client"` only for state, events, or context.
- **CVA** (`class-variance-authority`) for variant APIs on primitives.
- **`cn`** from the `cn` package (re-exported in `src/lib/utils.ts`). Prefer `import { cn } from "cn"` to match existing files.
- **Base UI, not Radix.** Links-as-buttons:

```tsx
<Button
  render={<Link href="/collection/new-arrivals" />}
  nativeButton={false}
  size="xl"
>
  Shop New Arrivals
</Button>
```

- **Button variants:** `default` | `outline` | `secondary` | `ghost` | `destructive` | `link`
- **Storefront CTAs:** prefer `size="xl"` (`h-12`)
- **ProductCard** → `/product/${product.id}` (`id` = Shopify handle)
- **PLPs:** `CatalogBrowser` / `CatalogFilters`
- **PDP:** `ProductExperience`
- **Policies:** `PolicyPage`

### Figma MCP mapping

1. Run / search design system against these names before generating new components.
2. Map Figma buttons → `Button` + variant/size, not custom `<button>` stacks.
3. Map frames to feature folders (`home/`, `product/`, …), not new top-level UI kits.
4. If adding Code Connect later, point templates at `@/components/ui/*` and domain components above.

