## 3. Frameworks and libraries

| Layer | Choice |
| --- | --- |
| Framework | Next.js 16 App Router (`src/app`) |
| UI | React 19 |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS v4 (`@import "tailwindcss"`), `tw-animate-css`, `shadcn/tailwind.css` |
| Primitives | `@base-ui/react` + shadcn `base-nova` |
| Icons | `lucide-react` |
| Variants | `class-variance-authority` |
| Class merge | `cn` package |
| Build | Next.js bundler (Turbopack/webpack via `next dev` / `next build`) |
| PostCSS | `@tailwindcss/postcss` only (`postcss.config.mjs`) |
| Path alias | `@/*` → `./src/*` |
| Tests | Playwright (`e2e/`), not component Storybook |
| Commerce | Shopify Storefront API + Customer Account API |

Do **not** add Radix, styled-components, CSS Modules, or a second component kit for Figma handoff.

