## 4. Asset management

### Static assets

- **Root:** `public/`
- **Images:** `public/images/**` served as `/images/...`
- **Fonts folder:** `public/fonts` exists; live UI fonts come from `next/font/google` (Source Sans 3, Cormorant Garamond)

Notable paths:

- `/images/hero.jpg`, `/images/logo.png`, `/images/logo-mobile.png`
- `/images/sustainability*.png`, `/images/shop-all/`, `/images/auth/`, `/images/followus/`, `/images/collection/`, etc.
- Legacy/static marketing folders may still exist under `modiweek/`, `plus-size/`, `new-in/`, `products/` — prefer Shopify CDN for live catalog imagery

### Product / remote images

- Use `next/image`
- Allowed remotes in `next.config.ts`: `cdn.shopify.com/**`, `images.unsplash.com/**`
- Formats: AVIF + WebP (`images.formats`)
- Catalog photos typically come from Shopify URLs on `Product` / cart line types, not `public/`

### Pattern

```tsx
import Image from "next/image"

<Image
  src="/images/hero.jpg"
  alt="…"
  width={2880}
  height={1200}
  priority
  sizes="100vw"
  className="h-auto w-full"
/>
```

No separate CDN config beyond Shopify/Unsplash remote patterns. No image CMS.

