## 7. Project structure

```
src/app/                 App Router pages (Server Components) + auth API routes
src/components/          UI by domain + ui/ primitives
src/data/                Static nav, FAQ, sustainability, shipping, heroes (not live catalog)
src/lib/shopify/         Storefront GraphQL, catalog, cart actions, mappers
src/lib/customer/        Customer Account OAuth/session
src/lib/catalog-params.ts  PLP sort/filter URL ↔ Shopify query
src/types/commerce.ts    Product, ProductDetail, CartSummary
public/images/           Static marketing assets
docs/agent-guide.md      Operational map
docs/pages.md            Per-route UI detail
components.json          shadcn config
```

### Patterns

- **Route → page (RSC) → feature components** with data fetched in the page or via server actions
- **Providers** in root layout: `WishlistProvider` → `CartProvider` → header / main / footer
- **No** `middleware.ts`, `loading.tsx`, `error.tsx`, or `not-found.tsx`
- Feature organization is **domain folders** under `components/`, not atomic design layers (`atoms/molecules`)

### Invariants that affect design implementation

- Payment is redirect to `cart.checkoutUrl` — never design card-capture UI for real charges
- `Product.id` is the handle; PDP route is `/product/[id]`
- PLP filters/sort are URL-driven Shopify queries — do not revive unused static filter chrome from `src/data/search.ts` / `plus-size.ts` unless asked

